01:42:32.476 --> 01:42:33.700
not as a security problem.

01:42:33.701 --> 01:42:34.690
&gt;&gt; Both.

01:42:34.691 --> 01:42:36.590
&gt;&gt; For security problem,
I guess you could,

01:42:36.591 --> 01:42:37.760
then you have to analyze all of

01:42:37.761 --> 01:42:39.120
