01:42:45.941 --> 01:42:47.380
I think it's certainly
possible yes,

01:42:47.381 --> 01:42:49.070
I believe it's
a higher overhead solution,

01:42:49.071 --> 01:42:49.865
because I think hardware,

01:42:49.866 --> 01:42:53.085
this is really the problem

01:42:53.086 --> 01:42:54.465
